  "description": "TIWTOL crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n b m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H48 La4 N8 O44 12-,4(H2 O1),20(Na1 1+),8(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 5.338-5.338 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 173.23-173.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Na12n[La(edta)(CO3)]4n·8nNaCl·4nH2O.",
